# Unit03
# 领域: 考研
# 学科: 英语词汇
# 来源: 2023红宝书考研英语词汇
# 描述: 基础词Unit03核心词汇

alike /əˈlaɪk/ adj./adv. 相似的；一样地 / The two sisters look very much alike.
alive /əˈlaɪv/ adj. 活着的；有活力的 / The fish is still alive after being out of water for a few minutes.
all /ɔːl/ adj./pron./adv. 所有的；全部 / All students must attend the orientation session.
alliance /əˈlaɪəns/ n. 联盟；同盟 / The two countries formed a military alliance.
allow /əˈlaʊ/ v. 允许；准许 / The rules do not allow smoking in the building.
ally /ˈælaɪ/ n./v. 同盟者；结盟 / The two companies decided to ally against their competitor.
almost /ˈɔːlmoʊst/ adv. 几乎；差不多 / Almost everyone in the class passed the exam.
alone /əˈloʊn/ adj./adv. 独自的；单独地 / She prefers to work alone rather than in a group.
along /əˈlɔːŋ/ prep./adv. 沿着；一起 / We walked along the river for an hour.
alongside /əˌlɔːŋˈsaɪd/ prep./adv. 在…旁边 / The ship anchored alongside the dock.
alphabet /ˈælfəbet/ n. 字母表 / The English alphabet has 26 letters.
already /ɔːlˈredi/ adv. 已经 / The train has already left the station.
also /ˈɔːlsoʊ/ adv. 也；同样 / She is not only intelligent but also very hardworking.
alter /ˈɔːltər/ v. 改变；修改 / They had to alter the plan due to bad weather.
alternative /ɔːlˈtɜːrnətɪv/ n./adj. 替代品；可选择的 / We need to find an alternative energy source.
although /ɔːlˈðoʊ/ conj. 虽然；尽管 / Although it was raining, we went hiking anyway.
altogether /ˌɔːltəˈɡeðər/ adv. 完全地；总共 / Altogether, there are 50 students in the class.
always /ˈɔːlweɪz/ adv. 总是；一直 / She always arrives at work on time.
amateur /ˈæmətər/ n./adj. 业余爱好者 / He is an amateur photographer who takes beautiful pictures.
amaze /əˈmeɪz/ v. 使惊奇；使惊叹 / The magician's tricks amazed the audience.
ambition /æmˈbɪʃn/ n. 雄心；抱负 / Her ambition is to become a successful entrepreneur.
ambitious /æmˈbɪʃəs/ adj. 有雄心的；野心勃勃的 / The young scientist has ambitious plans for the future.
ambulance /ˈæmbjələns/ n. 救护车 / The ambulance arrived within minutes of the call.
among /əˈmʌŋ/ prep. 在…之中 / She is among the top students in her class.
amount /əˈmaʊnt/ n./v. 数量；总计 / A large amount of money was spent on the project.
amuse /əˈmjuːz/ v. 使发笑；给…娱乐 / The comedian amused the audience with his jokes.
analyse /ˈænəlaɪz/ v. 分析 / Scientists analyse data to draw conclusions.
analysis /əˈnæləsɪs/ n. 分析 / The analysis of the survey results revealed interesting trends.
ancestor /ˈænsestər/ n. 祖先；祖宗 / Our ancestors lived in small farming communities.
ancient /ˈeɪnʃənt/ adj. 古代的；古老的 / The ancient ruins attract tourists from all over the world.
and /ænd/ conj. 和；而且 / Bread and butter is a simple breakfast.
anger /ˈæŋɡər/ n./v. 愤怒；激怒 / He tried to control his anger during the argument.
angle /ˈæŋɡl/ n. 角度；观点 / Let's look at the problem from a different angle.
angry /ˈæŋɡri/ adj. 生气的；愤怒的 / She was angry about the unfair treatment.
animal /ˈænɪml/ n. 动物 / Many animal species are endangered due to habitat loss.
announce /əˈnaʊns/ v. 宣布；通知 / The company announced a new product launch.
annoy /əˈnɔɪ/ v. 使恼怒；打扰 / Loud music from the neighbors annoys me.
annual /ˈænjuəl/ adj. 每年的；年度的 / The company holds an annual meeting in December.
anonymous /əˈnɑːnɪməs/ adj. 匿名的 / The donation was made by an anonymous benefactor.
another /əˈnʌðər/ adj./pron. 另一个 / Would you like another cup of tea?
answer /ˈænsər/ n./v. 回答；答案 / She gave a brilliant answer to the question.
anxiety /æŋˈzaɪəti/ n. 焦虑；不安 / Exam anxiety is a common problem among students.
anxious /ˈæŋkʃəs/ adj. 焦虑的；渴望的 / She was anxious about the results of the interview.
any /ˈeni/ adj./pron. 任何 / If you have any questions, feel free to ask.
anybody /ˈenibɑːdi/ pron. 任何人 / Is anybody home?
anyhow /ˈenihaʊ/ adv. 无论如何 / Anyhow, we should give it a try.
anyone /ˈeniwʌn/ pron. 任何人 / Anyone can learn to play the piano with practice.
anything /ˈeniθɪŋ/ pron. 任何事 / Is there anything I can help you with?
anyway /ˈeniweɪ/ adv. 无论如何 / It might rain, but we'll go anyway.
